Beast videos including 17 easter eggs &amp; hidden
details you might have missed in the new movie

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:42.960
and 10 movie mistakes and plot holes from
the animation that the new movie fixed.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:46.860
You can tap or click here to watch any of
